                       </div>\\n                        \\n                        <div id=\\\"import-options\\\" style=\\\"margin-top: 2rem; display: none;\\\">\\n                                <p style=\\\"color: #b3b3b3; padding: 1rem; background: rgba(90, 30, 30, 0.2); border-radius: 5px;\\\">注意：此选项是直接读取你的酒馆用户角色卡数据，请确保你的用户角色卡数据是完整的，不然建议选择自定义角色选项。</p>\\n                        </div>\\n                        \\n                        <div id=\\\"custom-options\\\" style=\\\"margin-top: 2rem; display: none;\\\">\\n                            <h3>自定义角色</h3>\\n                            <div class=\\\"input-group\\\">\\n                                <label for=\\\"char-name\\\">姓名</label>\\n                                <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"char-name\\\" class=\\\"forge-input\\\" placeholder=\\\"如：雷克斯、艾琳\\\">\\n                            </div>\\n                                <div class=\\\"input-group\\\">\\n                                    <label for=\\\"char-age\\\">年龄</label>\\n                                    <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"char-age\\\" class=\\\"forge-input\\\" placeholder=\\\"角色年龄（16-60）\\\" min=\\\"16\\\" max=\\\"60\\\">\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"input-group\\\">\\n                                <label for=\\\"char-gender\\\">性别</label>\\n                                <select id=\\\"char-gender\\\" class=\\\"forge-select\\\">\\n                                    <option value=\\\"male\\\">男性</option>\\n                                    <option value=\\\"female\\\">女性</option>\\n                                </select>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"input-group\\\">\\n                                <label for=\\\"char-appearance\\\">外观</label>\\n                                <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"char-appearance\\\" class=\\\"forge-input\\\" placeholder=\\\"如：短黑发、黝黑皮肤、肌肉型\\\">\\n                            </div>\\n                            <!-- 移除自定义说明输入框 -->\\n                        </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <!-- 步骤1：角色类型 -->\\n                <div class=\\\"step-content\\\" id=\\\"step-1\\\">\\n                    <div class=\\\"form-section\\\">\\n                        <h2>选择你的身份</h2>\\n                        <div class=\\\"options-grid\\\">\\n                            <div class=\\\"option-card ${this.player.role === 'fighter' ? 'selected' : ''}\\\" data-role=\\\"fighter\\\">\\n                                <h3>角斗士</h3>\\n                                <p>踏入铁笼，用鲜血与汗水铸就荣耀。</p>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <div class=\\\"option-card ${this.player.role === 'spectator' ? 'selected' : ''}\\\" data-role=\\\"spectator\\\">\\n                                <h3>观众</h3>\\n                                <p>置身场外，以智慧与胆识博弈命运。</p>\\n                            </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                        \\n                        <div id=\\\"fighter-options\\\" class=\\\"fighter-options\\\" style=\\\"display: ${this.player.role === 'fighter' ? 'block' : 'none'}; margin-top: 2rem;\\\">\\n                            <h3>角斗士专属选项</h3>\\n                            <div class=\\\"option-section\\\">\\n                                <h4>背景</h4>\\n                                <div class=\\\"options-grid\\\">\\n                                    <div class=\\\"option-card background-option ${this.player.background === 'poor' ? 'selected' : ''}\\\" data-value=\\\"poor\\\">\\n                                        <h3>贫民</h3>\\n                                        <p>来自城市底层，为了生存而战。</p>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div class=\\\"option-card background-option ${this.player.background === 'wanderer' ? 'selected' : ''}\\\" data-value=\\\"wanderer\\\">\\n                              